    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84172" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδοστράβη</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snare, gin,</i>
