				9.11
			</span></i> sq. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>instrument for straining</i> or <i>twisting the feet,</i> in
			surgical operations, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.182
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
