				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδοστράβη</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Lex.</u>
				10
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				366
			</span></i>.</div>
